{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 46, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to Nippon a land of grace!\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Kyoto a City of Ancient Might**\n\nUpon your vessel you shall arrive at Kansai's shore\nAnd journey forth to Kyoto a city to adore.\nThe train doth whisk thee past fields green and wide\nTo temples grand where history doth reside.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream\nA thousand torii a vibrant flowing stream.\nGion's district whispers tales of old\nGeishas glide in silks more precious than gold.\nDinner awaits a feast of wondrous fare\nWith sake to toast and blessings to declare.\n\n**Day Two: Temples Zen and Gardens Fair**\n\nTo Kinkaku-ji a golden temple bright\nReflecting sunbeams a most glorious sight.\nThen Ryoan-ji's garden a stone-filled space\nWhere contemplation finds its tranquil place.\nArashiyama's bamboo forest tall and green\nA swaying wonder a most serene scene.\nA boat ride on the Hozugawa's flow\nWhere nature's beauty doth serenely grow.\n\n**Day Three: Nara's Deer a Gentle Plea**\n\nA journey forth to Nara a city near\nWhere friendly deer hold court dispelling fear.\nTodai-ji's temple a giant Buddha sleeps\nWhile pilgrims pray and ancient silence keeps.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns softly gleam\nA thousand lights a visionary dream.\nReturn to Kyoto for a restful night\nAnd dreams of Japan bathed in gentle light.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty Mountains High**\n\nFarewell Kyoto a city rich and deep\nNow onward to Hakone where mountains sleep.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi a mirror's gleam\nReflecting peaks a picturesque extreme.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a sight to behold\nSculptures grand in stories yet untold.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing grace\nA tranquil haven a peaceful place.\n\n**Day Five: Tokyo's Metropolis a Vibrant Pace**\n\nFrom Hakone's calm to Tokyo's bustling heart\nA city vast a brand new work of art.\nShibuya's crossing a sea of human flow\nA vibrant pulse a captivating show.\nThe Imperial Palace a regal show\nWhere history's echoes softly grow.\nSenso-ji Temple Tokyo's ancient soul\nA vibrant prayer a story to extol.\nDinner in Shinjuku a dazzling view\nWith neon lights a spectacle anew.\n\n**Day Six: Culture and Wonders Tokyo's Gleam**\n\nThe Meiji Shrine a peaceful green domain\nWhere emperors pray and solace they obtain.\nHarajuku's fashion a bold display\nYouthful trends that brighten every day.\nThe Ghibli Museum a whimsical delight\nFor animation lovers a pure and joyful sight.\nExplore Akihabara electronics galore\nA technological marvel to explore.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell Sweet**\n\nThy journey ends the time doth fly\nFrom Nippon's shores to a distant sky.\nWith memories made and treasures to hold\nA story told in silver and in gold.\nFarewell Japan a land of beauty rare\nA whispered blessing beyond compare.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.0071897506713867}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.007763806264847517}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -0.6448058485984802}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -1.738816738128662}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.0002277830062666908}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.08422352373600006}, {"token": "▁grace", "logprob": -0.36958417296409607}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.40199440717697144}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.1421949714422226}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.44251978397369385}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.11506412923336029}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.7062200307846069}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.3266470730304718}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.004582617897540331}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.0009396428358741105}, {"token": "▁Kyoto", "logprob": -0.6029578447341919}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.40460634231567383}, {"token": "▁City", "logprob": -0.0035091983154416084}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.01800795085